      Q. 4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْلَحَبَّ</span></b>  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, right, direct,
rightly directed, straight,</i> or <i>even.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It</i>
(a road) <i>was extended:</i> (S:) or <i>conspicuous and
extended.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [And app. <i>It was,</i> or <i>became,
spread out,</i> or <i>expanded:</i> see the part n., below.]

